{"createdAt":"2025-08-03T18:03:46.606Z","updatedAt":"2025-10-27T09:03:08.000Z","id":"8o3kEW64NgfnPdpr","name":"Mock Interview Combined","active":false,"isArchived":false,"nodes":[{"parameters":{"content":"## Workflow1: Interview Setup =>\n**To show the user a form where they can enter the job role and paste their resume.** ","height":280,"width":720,"color":4},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-1360,-20],"typeVersion":1,"id":"a35c06b3-2395-42fd-921d-1214ddde0eea","name":"Sticky Note"},{"parameters":{"path":"interview-setup","responseMode":"responseNode","options":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.webhook","typeVersion":2,"position":[-1280,100],"id":"123e0c04-e211-48bc-9cec-a30eed431a49","name":"Webhook","webhookId":"771ecda2-ab7f-44e7-9b40-ff5d72e26d57"},{"parameters":{"respondWith":"text","responseBody":"={{ $json.html }}","options":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook","typeVersion":1.4,"position":[-840,100],"id":"38d3e30a-3712-432d-bebf-fd34411d9375","name":"Respond to Webhook"},{"parameters":{"html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Mock Interview Setup</title>\n  <style>\n    body { font-family: sans-serif; background-color: #f4f4f9; color: #333; margin: 2em; }\n    .container { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; background: #fff; padding: 2em; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }\n    h1 { color: #444; }\n    label { display: block; margin-top: 1em; margin-bottom: 0.5em; font-weight: bold; }\n    input, textarea { width: 100%; padding: 0.8em; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid #ccc; box-sizing: border-box; }\n    button { display: block; width: 100%; padding: 1em; margin-top: 2em; border: none; background-color: #007bff; color: #fff; font-size: 1em; border-radius: 4px; cursor: pointer; }\n    button:hover { background-color: #0056b3; }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <h1>Mock Interview Setup</h1>\n    <p>Please provide the job role you're applying for and paste your resume below to begin your personalized interview.</p>\n    <form action=\"https://n8n.dominixai.com/webhook/start-interview\" method=\"POST\">\n      <label for=\"jobRole\">Job Role:</label>\n      <input type=\"text\" id=\"jobRole\" name=\"jobRole\" required>\n      <label for=\"userEmail\">Your Email:</label>\n      <input type=\"email\" id=\"userEmail\" name=\"userEmail\" required>\n      <label for=\"resumeText\">Paste Resume:</label>\n      <textarea id=\"resumeText\" name=\"resumeText\" rows=\"15\" required></textarea>\n      <button type=\"submit\">Start Interview (10 Points)</button>\n    </form>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.html","typeVersion":1.2,"position":[-1060,100],"id":"0941d64f-b483-4552-9b77-9e2218efa270","name":"HTML"},{"parameters":{"method":"POST","url":"https://api.openai.com/v1/realtime/sessions","sendHeaders":true,"headerParameters":{"parameters":[{"name":"Authorization","value":"Bearer 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"}]},"sendBody":true,"contentType":"raw","rawContentType":"application/json","body":"={{ JSON.stringify({\n  instructions: $('Code').item.json.instructions,\n  model: \"gpt-4o-realtime-preview-2024-12-17\",\n  modalities: [\"audio\", \"text\"],\n  voice: \"alloy\",\n  input_audio_transcription: {\n    model: \"whisper-1\"\n  }\n}) }}","options":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","typeVersion":4.2,"position":[-120,120],"id":"660ea404-788a-4061-9af9-3cd2ac4ca538","name":"HTTP Request"},{"parameters":{"jsCode":"// The 'items' variable contains all incoming data.\n// We will loop through each item, modify it, and return it.\nfor (let item of items) {\n  // Get the body from the incoming JSON data of the current item\n  let body = item.json.body;\n\n  // Construct the instructions string\n  let instructions = \"You are a professional hiring manager. Your first task is to greet the user and confirm the role they are interviewing for by saying: 'Hello, thanks for coming in. Just to confirm, you're interviewing for the role of \" + body.jobRole + \", is that correct?'. Wait for their confirmation before proceeding with the interview. The entire interview must last for a maximum of 15 minutes. Use the candidate's resume, provided below, to ask specific and relevant questions. A minute or two before the time is up, you must gracefully conclude the conversation.\\\\n\\\\n---RESUME---\\\\n\" + body.resumeText + \"\\\\n---END RESUME---\";\n\n  // Add the new 'instructions' field to the JSON data of the current item\n  item.json.instructions = instructions;\n}\n\n// Return all the modified items to be passed to the next node\nreturn items;"},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","typeVersion":2,"position":[-340,120],"id":"4f3f8902-0825-4c70-9d75-3e66d4e1eef1","name":"Code"},{"parameters":{"assignments":{"assignments":[{"id":"0d0fdf66-cc36-4ba0-8bfd-c560bcb1060d","name":"ephemeralKey","value":"={{ $json.client_secret.value }}","type":"string"}]},"options":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.set","typeVersion":3.4,"position":[100,120],"id":"e39b2625-f6bb-435b-8544-815429f39723","name":"Edit Fields"},{"parameters":{"httpMethod":"POST","path":"start-interview","responseMode":"responseNode","options":{"allowedOrigins":"*"}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.webhook","typeVersion":2,"position":[-560,120],"id":"50d55dfd-7a1b-49f3-9065-5c6e4d37f986","name":"Webhook1","webhookId":"32b73c7b-424e-4ed7-aa29-25ffbb46f1ee"},{"parameters":{"html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\" />\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>NanoAI RT</title>\n  \n  <style>\n    .container {\n      background-color: #ffffff;\n      text-align: left;\n      padding: 16px;\n      border-radius: 8px;\n    }\n    .msg {\n      padding: 5px; \n      background-color: #eee;\n    }\n    .msgUsr {\n      padding: 5px; \n      background-color: #e4eefd;\n    }\n    .curMsg {\n      padding: 5px; \n      background-color: #e6ffd9;\n    }\n    h1 {\n      margin: 5px;\n      font-size: 20px;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n    \n  <h1>Let's talk! You go first...</h1>\n  <div id=\"timer\" style=\"font-size: 1.2em; font-weight: bold; color: #d9534f; margin-bottom: 1em;\"></div>\n  <div class=\"container\">\n    <div class=\"messages\"></div>\n    <div class=\"curMsg\"></div>    \n    <button id=\"finishButton\">Finish Interview & Get Report</button>\n  </div>\n  \n<script>\n  const userEmail = \"{{ $('Webhook1').item.json.body.userEmail }}\";\n  document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', (event) => {\n    const finishButton = document.getElementById('finishButton');\n    if (finishButton) {\n      finishButton.addEventListener('click', async () => {\n        const messagesDiv = document.querySelector('.messages');\n        const transcript = messagesDiv.innerText;\n\n        finishButton.disabled = true;\n        finishButton.innerText = \"Generating Report...\";\n\n        const response = await fetch('https://n8n.dominixai.com/webhook/generate-report', {\n          method: 'POST',\n          headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\n          // FIX: Removed the extra comma at the end of this line\n          body: JSON.stringify({ transcript: transcript, email: userEmail })\n        });\n\n        const reportHtml = await response.text();\n        document.body.innerHTML = reportHtml;\n      });\n    }\n  });\n\n  function startTimer(duration, display) {\n    let timer = duration * 60, minutes, seconds;\n\n    const interval = setInterval(function () {\n      minutes = parseInt(timer / 60, 10);\n      seconds = parseInt(timer % 60, 10);\n\n      minutes = minutes < 10 ? \"0\" + minutes : minutes;\n      seconds = seconds < 10 ? \"0\" + seconds : seconds;\n\n      display.textContent = \"Time Remaining: \" + minutes + \":\" + seconds;\n\n      if (--timer < 0) {\n        clearInterval(interval);\n        display.textContent = \"Time's up! Generating your report...\";\n        document.getElementById('finishButton').click();\n      }\n    }, 1000);\n  }\n  \n  function handleResponse(e) {\n    var obj = JSON.parse(e.data);\n    \n    if (obj.type == 'response.audio_transcript.done') {\n      document.querySelector('.curMsg').innerHTML = \"\";\n      document.querySelector('.messages').innerHTML += \"<div class='msg'>AI: \" + obj.transcript + \"</div><br/>\";\n    }\n\n    if (obj.type == 'conversation.item.input_audio_transcription.completed') {\n      document.querySelector('.curMsg').innerHTML = \"\";\n      document.querySelector('.messages').innerHTML += \"<div class='msgUsr'>User: \" + obj.transcript + \"</div><br/>\";\n    }\n    \n    if (obj.type == 'response.audio_transcript.delta') {\n      document.querySelector('.curMsg').innerHTML += obj.delta;\n    }\n  \n    if (obj.type == 'conversation.item.input_audio_transcription.delta') {\n      document.querySelector('.curMsg').innerHTML += obj.delta;\n    }\n  }\n\n  async function init() {\n    // Starts the timer as soon as the interview begins\n    const interviewDuration = 15; \n    const display = document.querySelector('#timer');\n    startTimer(interviewDuration, display);\n\n    // Get an ephemeral key from your server\n    const EPHEMERAL_KEY = \"{{ $json.ephemeralKey }}\";\n    // FIX: Removed the duplicate declaration of EPHEMERAL_KEY\n\n    // Create a peer connection\n    const pc = new RTCPeerConnection();\n\n    // Set up to play remote audio from the model\n    const audioEl = document.createElement(\"audio\");\n    audioEl.autoplay = true;\n    pc.ontrack = e => audioEl.srcObject = e.streams[0];\n\n    // Add local audio track for microphone input in the browser\n    const ms = await navigator.mediaDevices.getUserMedia({\n      audio: true\n    });\n    pc.addTrack(ms.getTracks()[0]);\n\n    // Set up data channel for sending and receiving events\n    const dc = pc.createDataChannel(\"oai-events\");\n    dc.addEventListener(\"message\", (e) => {\n      // Realtime server events appear here!\n      console.log(e);\n      handleResponse(e);\n    });\n\n    // Start the session using the Session Description Protocol (SDP)\n    const offer = await pc.createOffer();\n    await pc.setLocalDescription(offer);\n\n    const baseUrl = \"https://api.openai.com/v1/realtime\";\n    const model = \"gpt-4o-realtime-preview-2024-12-17\";\n    const sdpResponse = await fetch(`${baseUrl}?model=${model}`, {\n      method: \"POST\",\n      body: offer.sdp,\n      headers: {\n        Authorization: `Bearer ${EPHEMERAL_KEY}`,\n        \"Content-Type\": \"application/sdp\"\n      },\n    });\n\n    const answer = {\n      type: \"answer\",\n      sdp: await sdpResponse.text(),\n    };\n    await pc.setRemoteDescription(answer);\n  }\n\n  // This starts the whole process\n  init();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>"},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.html","typeVersion":1.2,"position":[320,120],"id":"e0407b96-3425-438d-9520-f754cfbbfee0","name":"HTML1"},{"parameters":{"respondWith":"text","responseBody":"={{ $json.html }}","options":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook","typeVersion":1.1,"position":[540,120],"id":"e25fdbf2-b0f6-4e7f-bc56-04d94fb95b40","name":"Respond to Webhook1"},{"parameters":{"content":"## Workflow2: Time Interview Engine=>\n**To receive the form data from Workflow 1, create a custom AI session, and serve the real-time chat page..** ","height":300,"width":1300,"color":4},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[-610,-20],"typeVersion":1,"id":"d5c5aa8e-6b3a-4d13-b30b-73bc95085685","name":"Sticky Note1"},{"parameters":{"sendTo":"={{ $('Webhook2').item.json.body.email }}","subject":"Your Mock Interview Performance Report","message":"={{ $json.text }}","options":{"appendAttribution":false}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.gmail","typeVersion":2.1,"position":[1420,-80],"id":"9050f3df-0811-4e70-8771-6c6249926c17","name":"Send interview assessment report","webhookId":"6e77c5a9-3cdb-4e19-8eb1-a9759b1820b7","credentials":{"gmailOAuth2":{"id":"ruloI1GkFQqksqlC","name":"denorgerald@gmail.com"}}},{"parameters":{"promptType":"define","text":"=You are a rigorous and objective hiring manager and career coach. Your primary goal is to provide strict, fair, and incredibly helpful feedback to help the user improve their real-world interview skills. Do not be overly positive or vague; focus on direct, constructive criticism.\n\nYou will assess the interview based on the following five criteria. Score each criterion on a scale of 1-20. The final \"Overall Score\" must be the sum of these five scores.\n\n**Assessment Criteria:**\n1.  **Clarity & Conciseness ( /20):** Were the answers clear, easy to understand, and to the point? Or were they rambling and unfocused?\n2.  **Relevance & STAR Method ( /20):** Did the candidate directly answer the questions asked? Did they use specific examples and evidence from their experience, ideally following the STAR method (Situation, Task, Action, Result)?\n3.  **Experience Alignment ( /20):** How well did the candidate connect their skills and resume experience to the requirements of the job role they are interviewing for?\n4.  **Confidence & Professionalism ( /20):** Based on the language used, did the candidate project a professional and confident tone?\n5.  **Engagement ( /20):** Did the candidate show interest in the role? Did they ask clarifying questions or engage in a two-way conversation, rather than just passively answering?\n\nYour analysis **must be in HTML format** and follow this exact structure:\n\n1.  An `<h1>` tag with the **Overall Score / 100**. This is the sum of the five criteria scores.\n2.  An `<h2>` tag for **Performance Summary**: A brief, high-level overview of the performance.\n3.  An `<h2>` tag for **Scoring Breakdown**: A `<ul>` list where each list item details one of the five criteria and the score given (e.g., `<li><strong>Clarity & Conciseness:</strong> 15/20</li>`).\n4.  An `<h2>` tag for **Strengths**: A `<ul>` list detailing what the candidate did well, referencing the high-scoring criteria.\n5.  An `<h2>` tag for **Areas for Improvement**: A `<ul>` list explaining where the candidate struggled, referencing the low-scoring criteria. This section is critical.\n6.  An `<h2>` tag for **Actionable Advice**: A `<ul>` list with specific, concrete steps the user can take to improve on their weaknesses. For example, if they scored low on \"Relevance,\" suggest practicing the STAR method with examples from their resume.\n\nHere is the transcript to analyze:\n{{ $json.body.transcript }}","batching":{}},"type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chainLlm","typeVersion":1.7,"position":[1040,20],"id":"991c0e12-a590-44dc-b4f1-d24a432c3735","name":"Interview Assessor"},{"parameters":{"model":"deepseek/deepseek-r1:free","options":{}},"type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenRouter","typeVersion":1,"position":[1120,240],"id":"6b599fe6-8f7a-40cd-931e-53e603f69533","name":"OpenRouter Chat Model","credentials":{"openRouterApi":{"id":"5PDv0ZxYOLkxlcrr","name":"OpenRouter account"}}},{"parameters":{"content":"## Workflow3: Performance Report Generator=> \n**To receive the finished interview transcript, get an AI analysis, and show it to the user.**","height":480,"width":840,"color":4},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","position":[740,-100],"typeVersion":1,"id":"640a68eb-9e6d-4a25-8a4d-87ae9b871e7d","name":"Sticky Note2"},{"parameters":{"httpMethod":"POST","path":"generate-report","responseMode":"responseNode","options":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.webhook","typeVersion":2,"position":[820,20],"id":"c9fef6cf-f67b-4c0e-882e-6e1f2246c04e","name":"Webhook2","webhookId":"2587540b-3552-4617-82c2-06b0729d1d6c"},{"parameters":{"respondWith":"text","responseBody":"={{ $json.text }}","options":{}},"type":"n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook","typeVersion":1.4,"position":[1420,